mic coordinator"},{"text":"Nursing education leadership"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Nursing — Nursing Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for candidates who want to combine:"},{"type":"h","text":"Education + Nursing Management"},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Nursing — Clinical Specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical-Surgical Nursing"},{"text":"Child Health Nursing"},{"text":"Mental Health Nursing"},{"text":"Community Health Nursing"},{"text":"Obstetric & Gynaecological Nursing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD in Nursing"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term progression into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nursing research"},{"text":"Academic leadership"},{"text":"Senior faculty positions"},{"text":"Research leadership"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Clinical Education"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on teaching students and nurses in clinical environments."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Skills-Lab Education"},{"type":"p","text":"Specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procedure demonstration"},{"text":"Simulation"},{"text":"Competency assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Simulation-Based Education"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop realistic clinical scenarios and simulation programmes."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Nursing Faculty"},{"type":"p","text":"Move into formal academic teaching."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Staff Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Train practicing nurses in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"New procedures"},{"text":"Patient safety"},{"text":"Infection control"},{"text":"Hospital protocols"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Nursing Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Move toward evidence-based education and clinical research."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Registered Nurse","Clinical Nurse","Clinical Instructor / Nursing Educator","Senior Clinical Instructor","Nursing Faculty / Education C